  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131na \u015F\xF6yle bir g\xF6z att\u0131\u011F\u0131mda, telvelerinde
    i\xE7 d\xFCnyan\u0131n haritas\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCr gibiyim {{isim}}. \U0001F5FA\uFE0FTelvelerin
    dallan\u0131p budakland\u0131\u011F\u0131 yerler adeta beyninin k\u0131vr\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131
    temsil ediyor. \U0001F9E0 Daha yak\u0131ndan bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131mda, zihninde
    d\xF6n\xFCp dola\u015Fan d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin i\xE7 y\xFCz\xFCn\xFC g\xF6r\xFCyorum.
    Bu d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin i\xE7inde sanki binlerce \"han\xE7er\" sakl\u0131.
    \U0001F5E1\uFE0FBu han\xE7erler, y\xFCre\u011Finin ta\u015Fla\u015Fm\u0131\u015F
    yerlerine s\xFCrterek bilenmi\u015F. {{kelime, Sivri u\xE7lu | Keskin kenarl\u0131}}
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin kar\u015F\u0131ndaki insanda derin yaralar a\xE7madan
    evvel, kar\u015F\u0131 taraf\u0131n \xF6nemli bir ad\u0131m ataca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hissediyorum."
